---

<section class="lumen-section">
  <div class="lumen-container">
    <nav style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--lu-text-muted);margin-bottom:1rem">
      <a href="/demo/lumen-electric/" style="color:var(--lu-yellow)">HOME</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <span>SERVICE AREA</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="lumen-eyebrow">Coverage</span>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--lu-font-display);font-size:clamp(2.25rem,1.6rem+2.5vw,3.5rem);color:var(--lu-black);line-height:1.05;margin:0.5rem 0 1.25rem;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Wired up across <em style="color:var(--lu-yellow);font-style:normal">Northern Colorado.</em></h1>
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--lu-text);max-width:60ch">Service work, panel upgrades, EV charger installs, and solar tie-ins from Fort Collins down to Boulder, west to Estes Park, east to Greeley. Click any pin for what we are doing most in that area.</p>
  </div>
